From: Xbox360 Blades <xbox360-blades@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 29 Sep 2026 10:04:40 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 13/51] Dashboard DVD tray: open/close the tray and pick a disc

HalOpenCloseODDTray now opens and closes the emulated tray. Opening it
shows a small Windows window (--disc_folder) listing the .iso files; the
chosen disc is mounted at \Device\Cdrom0 when the dashboard closes the
tray, and is remembered in dvd_drive.txt. The launch handoff carries the
disc image path so the launcher can start the game the dashboard chose.

